# Content-queue processing (Werba Way)

You own the organizational pipeline for new lessons in `CONTENT_SPEC.md` format. Claude/Yura own content only. Do not rewrite lesson wording. Full rules: `docs/CURSOR_RULES.md`.

## Trigger

New files in `content-queue/lectures/pending/` or `content-queue/exercises/pending/` → process autonomously (except delete/overwrite of already published content — ask first).

## Pipeline

1. Validate frontmatter/json and required `image_keywords` / `header_image_keywords`.
2. Resolve all `[IMAGE: ...]` and `image_keywords` via stock photos → `public/content/<lesson_id>/`.
3. Publish interactive exercises as public LMS embeds under `/embed/[lessonId]/{vocab|pictures|comm-tasks|grammar|hw}`.
4. Publish Notion lecture page under module parent from `module_map.json`. Section order: reading → questions → vocab → conversation → pictures → flip-task → grammar → summary → homework.
5. Move files pending → published; append `_manifest.json`; `git commit -m "content: <lesson_id>"` && `git push`.

## Notion embeds — CRITICAL

Every exercise MUST be a real embed iframe block, NEVER a markdown link:

```
<embed src="https://werba-way.vercel.app/embed/{lesson_id}/{exercise-type}">Підпис вправи</embed>
```

FORBIDDEN (publish is incomplete if any remain):

```
[Otwórz vocab-cards](https://werba-way.vercel.app/embed/...)
```

## Vocabulary = Quizlet (v3.6, from 2026-10-17)

If the lesson `.md` has a `[QUIZLET: set_id="…", url="…"]` marker, or `-vocab.json` has `"publish": "quizlet"`:

- Do NOT publish `/embed/{lesson_id}/vocab` and do NOT generate vocab TTS.
- In Notion, section «2. Słownictwo» gets the Quizlet set as a real embed block: `<embed src="https://quizlet.com/{set_id}/flashcards/embed">Słownictwo — Quizlet</embed>`.
- Never create or edit Quizlet sets yourself. Full rules: `docs/SPEC_PATCH_v3.6.md`.
- STILL copy `{id}-vocab.json` to `src/content/queue-published/` together with comm-tasks, grammar, hw, slides. Without it `getQueueBundle` returns null and EVERY embed of the lesson is 404.
- Publish the Notion page only after the Vercel deploy is live and each embed URL returns 200; otherwise Notion stores a "Click to view content" placeholder instead of the embed.
- No TTS/audio for new lessons: `c1` is `read-then-play`.

Self-check before marking published: no `[Otwórz ...](` in page content; no `/embed/{lesson_id}/vocab` on Quizlet lessons. Images must be `![Caption](URL)`, not text links. Grammar as Notion `<table>` block. Videos as `<video src="URL">Caption</video>`, never markdown links.

## Image quality

Reject any stock photo with visible text, signage, watermarks, digital clocks, or UI chrome (any language). Honor `image_constraints` from exercise JSON when present.

## Hard limits

- Never edit Claude’s text — only layout, images, embeds.
- Invalid/incomplete pending → leave in pending, log reason.
- Do not delete `published/` or rewrite `_manifest.json` retroactively without explicit instruction.
- Notion embeds must use public (no-auth) embed URLs.
